e2tre","address_street_name":"Avenue des Grenadiers","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue des Grenadiers, 48","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Vous cherchez une soir\u00e9e pleine d'humour et de divertissement ? Vous \u00eates alors \u00e0 la bonne adresse (attention, celle-ci a chang\u00e9 en 2019). Par la d\u00e9tente, l'interaction et l'\u00e9motion, il vise \u00e0 relier les gens par et \u00e0 travers le th\u00e9\u00e2tre bruxellois et \u00e0 les renvoyer chez eux avec un sentiment de sati\u00e9t\u00e9 et d'exub\u00e9rance. Dans ce th\u00e9\u00e2tre de quartier, le texte et l'\u00e9motion occupent une place pr\u00e9pond\u00e9rante, car en plus de la com\u00e9die, retrouvez aussi de la po\u00e9sie, de la philosophie, des contes et du th\u00e9\u00e2tre jeune public.   \r\n\r\n ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Fou Rire","address_street_name":"Avenue des Grenadiers","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue des Grenadiers, 48","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Fou Rire","address_street_name":"Grenadierslaan","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Grenadierslaan, 48","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Op zoek naar een avond vol humor en vermaak? Dan bij je bij Le Fou Rire aan het juiste (sinds 2019 nieuwe!) adres, want dat betekent \u2018slappe lach\u2019 in het Frans. Via ontspanning, wisselwerking en emotie wil dit door en door Brussels theater mensen verbinden en hen met een verzadigd en uitgelaten gevoel weer naar huis sturen. Tekst en emotie krijgen een glansrol in dit buurttheater, want naast stand-upcomedy komen ook po\u00ebzie, filosofie en zelfs sprookjes en jeugdtheater ruimschoots aan bod.   ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"lefourire","backoffice_id":11226,"location":{"lat":50.8097778,"lon":4.3917894},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-11-07T14:28:15+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:30:00+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":249081,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Fou Rire","address_street_name":"Avenue des Grenadiers","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue des Grenadiers, 48","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Fou Rire","address_street_name":"Avenue des Grenadiers","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1"