Sensibles\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005717"},"pt":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle pr\u00e9sente Jo\u00ebl Denot avec \"Plaques Sensibles\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005717"},"en":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle pr\u00e9sente Jo\u00ebl Denot avec \"Plaques Sensibles\"","shortdescr":"Jo\u00ebl Denot, exhausted by the ever-increasing proliferation of images conveyed by the new media, returns to the early history of photography, its long exposure times and the serendipity they engender.","longdescr":"Jo\u00ebl Denot, exhausted by the ever-increasing proliferation of images conveyed by the new media, returns to the beginnings of the history of photography, its long exposure times and the hazards they engender.\nExposure time - The first of the temporalities that Jo\u00ebl Denot's photographs confront is exposure time, which conditions the impression of light variations on the sensitive plate, transforming them into matter. The exposure time is the very tool of his work: all his photographs are entirely taken at the time of shooting, without any subsequent modification, without any digital intervention, and it is the opening times, generally very long, that determine the appearance or disappearance of the subject, the intensity of the color, the greater or lesser dilution of the colored atmosphere. \nThese durations are the result of complex calculations, noted day by day according to light readings, from which precise exposure times are derived, just as the masks used to create the luminous impacts by burning the negative are precisely traced - the extreme technicality that makes his work so special. The idea is to use exposure time as a means of capturing light so that it can be inscribed on the sensitive plate. Writing with light.\nPhoto-graphein, as described by one of its pioneers, William Herschel. The exposure time was counted in long minutes, sometimes hours. ","performers":"Modesti Perdriolle presents Jo\u00ebl Denot \u201cPlaques Sensibles","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005717"},"it":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle pr\u00e9sente Jo\u00ebl Denot avec \"Plaques Sensibles\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005717"},"cn":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle pr\u00e9sente Jo\u00ebl Denot avec \"Plaques Sensibles\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005717"},"fr":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle pr\u00e9sente Jo\u00ebl Denot avec \"Plaques Sensibles\"","shortdescr":"Jo\u00ebl Denot, \u00e9puis\u00e9 par la prolif\u00e9ration sans cesse croissante d\u2019images v\u00e9hicul\u00e9es par les nouveaux m\u00e9dias, renoue avec les d\u00e9buts de l\u2019histoire de la photographie, ses longs temps de pose et les hasards que ceux-ci engendrent.","longdescr":"Jo\u00ebl Denot, \u00e9puis\u00e9 par la prolif\u00e9ration sans cesse croissante d\u2019images v\u00e9hicul\u00e9es par les nouveaux m\u00e9dias, renoue avec les d\u00e9buts de l\u2019histoire de la photographie, ses longs temps de pose et les hasards que ceux-ci engendrent.\nTemps de pose - Premi\u00e8re des temporalit\u00e9s auxquelles se confrontent les photographies de Jo\u00ebl Denot, le temps de pose, qui conditionne l\u2019impression sur la plaque sensible des variations de la lumi\u00e8re afin de les transformer en mati\u00e8re. Le temps de pose est l\u2019outil m\u00eame de son travail : toutes ses photographies sont enti\u00e8rement faites \u00e0 la prise de vue, sans aucune modification ult\u00e9rieure, sans aucune intervention num\u00e9rique, et ce sont les temps d\u2019ouverture, g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement tr\u00e8s longs, qui d\u00e9terminent l\u2019apparition ou la disparition du sujet, l\u2019intensit\u00e9 de la couleur, la plus ou moins grande dilution de l\u2019atmosph\u00e8re color\u00e9e. \nDes dur\u00e9es qui sont le r\u00e9sultat de calculs complexes, not\u00e9s au jour le jour en fonction de relev\u00e9s lumineux, d\u2019o\u00f9 d\u00e9coulent des temps d\u2019exposition pr\u00e9cis, comme sont pr\u00e9cis\u00e9ment trac\u00e9s les caches servant \u00e0 cr\u00e9er les impacts lumineux par br\u00fblures du n\u00e9gatif \u2013 technicit\u00e9 extr\u00eame qui fait toute la sp\u00e9cificit\u00e9 de son travail. Un propos qui ram\u00e8ne tr\u00e8s directement \u00e0 la photographie ancienne : faire du temps de pose le moyen de capter la lumi\u00e8re afin qu\u2019elle s\u2019inscrive sur la plaque sensible. \u00c9crire avec la lumi\u00e8re.\nPhoto-graphein, tel que devait la d\u00e9crire un de ses pionniers, William Herschel. Temps de pose qui se comptait en longues minutes, en heures parfois. ","performers":"Modesti Perdriolle pr\u00e9sente Jo\u00ebl Denot avec \"Plaques Sensibles\"","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005717"},"sp":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle pr\u00e9sente Jo\u00ebl Denot avec \"Plaques Sensibles\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005717"},"nl":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle pr\u00e9sente Jo\u00ebl Denot avec \"Plaques Sensibles\"","shortdescr":"Jo\u00ebl Denot, uitgeput door de alsmaar toenemende proliferatie van beelden die door de nieuwe media worden overgebracht, herbekijkt de vroege geschiedenis van de fotografie, haar lange belichtingstijden en de serendipiteit die ze teweegbrengen.","longdescr":"Jo\u00ebl Denot, uitgeput door de steeds toenemende verspreiding van beelden door de nieuwe media, keert terug naar het begin van de geschiedenis van de fotografie, de lange belichtingstijden en de serendipiteit die deze met zich meebrengen.\nBelichtingstijd - De eerste van de temporaliteiten waarmee de foto's van Jo\u00ebl Denot worden geconfronteerd is de belichtingstijd, die de indruk die de lichtvariaties op de gevoelige plaat maken, conditioneert om ze in materie om te zetten. De belichtingstijd is het eigenlijke instrument van zijn werk: al zijn foto's worden volledig genomen op het moment van de opname, zonder enige latere wijziging, zonder enige digitale tussenkomst, en het zijn de belichtingstijden, meestal zeer lang, die het verschijnen of verdwijnen van het onderwerp, de intensiteit van de kleur, de grotere of kleinere verdunning van de gekleurde atmosfeer bepalen. \nDeze tijden zijn het resultaat van complexe berekeningen, die dag na dag worden vastgelegd op basis van lichtmetingen, waaruit precieze belichtingstijden worden afgeleid, net zoals de maskers die worden gebruikt om de lichteffecten te cre\u00ebren door het negatief te branden, nauwkeurig worden getraceerd - een extreme techniciteit die zijn werk zo bijzonder maakt. Het is een benadering die direct teruggrijpt naar de vroege fotografie: het gebruik van belichtingstijd als middel om licht vast te leggen zodat het op de gevoelige plaat kan worden geschreven. Schrijven met licht.\nPhoto-graphein, zoals beschreven door een van de pioniers, William Herschel. De belichtingstijd werd geteld in lange minuten, soms uren. ","performers":"Modesti Perdriolle overhandigt Jo\u00ebl Denot \u201cPlaques Sensibles","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005717"}},"place":{"id":274938,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Galerie Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Georges","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"492310119","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Saint-Georges, 27","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Galerie Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Georges","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"492310119","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Saint-Georges, 27","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Georges","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"492310119","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Saint-Georges, 27","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Max Modesti and Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle met in 2012 at the India Art Fair in New Delhi. Both share a passion for India. Their paths have often crossed, in India as in France, mainly around emerging Indian artists that the first collects and that the second exhibits. Both leave Paris for Brussels,\r\n\r\nMax in 2015, Herv\u00e9 in 2019. It was during their wanderings and discussions in Brussels that the idea of opening a gallery was born.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\"Art is what makes life more interesting than art\", this quote from\r\n\r\nRobert Filliou also illustrates what unites Max Modesti and\r\n\r\nHerv\u00e9 Perdriolle, a pronounced taste for the encounters and adventures that the art world arouses.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Galerie Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Georges","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"492310119","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Saint-Georges, 27","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Galerie Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Georges","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"492310119","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Saint-Georges, 27","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Georges","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"492310119","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Saint-Georges, 27","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Modesti Perdriolle","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Galerie Herv\u00e9 Perdriolle","address_street_name":"Rue Saint-Georges","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"492310119","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Saint-Georges, 27","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Modesti Perdriolle Gallery","address_street_name":"Sint-Jorisstraat","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.modestiperdriolle.com","phone_contact":"492310119","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Sint-Jorisstraat, 27","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":"gallery","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":34938,"location":{"lat":50.81846081,"lon":4.36872613},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2025-02-10T12:48:02+01:00","published_at":"2019-12-16T08:23:35+01:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":255511,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Sophie Carree - presse+communication","address_street_name":"Avenue Minerve","address_street_number":"9","address_street_box":"129","email":"press@sophiecarree.be","website":"http:\/\/www.sophiecarree.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 346 05 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Minerve, 9 \/ 129","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtu