ll],"en":["Afterwork"],"it":["Afterwork"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Afterwork"],"sp":["Afterwork"],"nl":["Afterwork"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Gin Jeudi goes to Rooftop  - Indoor edition | Free Entrance","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/685481183938270\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007002"},"pt":{"name":"Gin Jeudi goes to Rooftop  - Indoor edition | Free Entrance","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/685481183938270\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007002"},"en":{"name":"Gin Jeudi goes to Rooftop  - Indoor edition | Free Entrance","shortdescr":"This Thursday 27.02.2025 \/ Sky is the limit \/ 360\u00b0 BXL view\nFree afterwork","longdescr":"This Thursday 27.02 \/ SKY IS THE LIMIT \/ 360\u00b0 BXL VIEW\nGin Jeudi goes to Rooftop 58 - Indoor edition | Free Entrance - This Thursday 27.02 \nFREE AFTERWORK\nFACEBOOK \/ https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/5krWOvKvv\nFREE TICKETS \/ https:\/\/www.eventbrite.be\/...\/gin-jeudi-x-rooftop-58...\n\n\nGin Jeudi - Thirstday is delighted to invite you to an exclusive \"Indoor\" rooftop afterwork - boasting one of the highest and most spectacular views of Brussels' skyline!\nBring your friends, join the fun, mix and mingle, while enjoying a breathtaking 360\u00b0 bird-eye overview of the heart of Brussels. What a better way to ease you through the end of the week?\nLet the business beGin  \nSKY IS THE LIMIT\n360\u00b0 BXL VIEW\nAFTERWORK\n\n\nGin Jeudi BACK TO BUSINESS EDITION\nTHURSDAY 27.02 >> 18:00 - 01:00\n WHAT TO EXPECT:\n Delicious cocktails crafted to perfection\n Sharing food for all the foodies out there\n Commercial music to keep you dancing from 6:00 to 1 AM\n+ the Best Gins in town\n\n\nFirst In, Best Served!  NO BOOKING \/ FIRST IN = GARANTY PARTICIPATION we strongly encourage you to arrive early! While Rooftop 58 has a large capacity, if we are full, a natural turnover of participants will be implemented.\n\n\nNEW \/ Customized Service for Businesses During the Holiday Season (What's Up +32478586039) or event@58.brussels\nThe Rooftop 58 is the perfect place for corporate events, private events or for groups parties.\nWith us, you can privitize the rooftop or exclusive spaces for your event\n\n\nSee you there!\nROOFTOP 58 - Exclusive new location\nRue de l'\u00c9v\u00e8que 1 , Brussels, Belgium","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/685481183938270\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007002"},"it":{"name":"Gin Jeudi goes to Rooftop  - Indoor edition | Free Entrance","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/685481183938270\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007002"},"cn":{"name":"Gin Jeudi goes to Rooftop  - Indoor edition | Free Entrance","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/685481183938270\/","email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":"+32 478 58 60 39","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700007002"},"fr":{"name":"Gin Jeudi Afterwork au Rooftop - Indoor edition | Entr\u00e9e gratuite","shortdescr":"Ce jeudi 27.02.2025 \/ Sky is the limit \/ 360\u00b0 BXL view\nAfterwork gratuit","longdescr":"Ce jeudi 27.02 \/ Sky is the limit \/ 360\u00b0 BXL view\nGin Jeudi s'invite au Rooftop 58 - \u00c9dition Indoor | Entr\u00e9e gratuite - Ce jeudi 27.02\nAfterwork gratuit\n\nFACEBOOK \/ https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/5krWOvKvv\nTICKETS GRATUITS \/ https:\/\/www.eventbrite.be\/...\/gin-jeudi-x-rooftop-58...\n\nGin Jeudi - Thirstday a le plaisir de vous inviter \u00e0 un afterwork exclusif en rooftop \"indoor\", offrant l'une des vues les plus hautes et spectaculaires sur la skyline de Bruxelles !\n\nAmenez vos amis, profitez de l'ambiance, faites des rencontres et admirez une vue panoramique \u00e0 360\u00b0 imprenable sur le c\u0153ur de Bruxelles. Quoi de mieux pour bien terminer la semaine ?\n\nQue les affaires commencent !\n\nSky is the limit\n360\u00b0 BXL view\nAfterwork\n\nGin Jeudi BACK TO BUSINESS EDITION\nJeudi 27.02 >> 18:00 - 01:00\n\nAu programme :\n\nD\u00e9licieux cocktails pr\u00e9par\u00e9s \u00e0 la perfection\nPlats \u00e0 partager pour tous les gourmets\nMusique commerciale pour vous faire danser de 18h00 \u00e0 01h00\nLes meilleurs gins de la ville\nPremiers arriv\u00e9s, premiers servis !\nPas de r\u00e9servation \/ Premier arriv\u00e9 = participation garantie. Nous vous recommandons vivement d'arriver t\u00f4t ! Bien que le Rooftop 58 ait une grande capacit\u00e9, en cas de forte affluence, un roulement naturel des participants sera mis en place.\n\nNouveau \/ Service personnalis\u00e9 pour les entreprises pendant la saison des f\u00eates\n(WhatsApp +32478586039) ou event@58.brussels\n\nLe Rooftop 58 est l'endroit id\u00e9al pour organiser des \u00e9v\u00e9nements professionnels, des soir\u00e9es priv\u00e9es ou des f\u00eates de groupe.\nVous avez la possibilit\u00e9 de privatiser le rooftop ou des espaces exclusifs pour votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement.\n\n\u00c0 tr\u00e8s bient\u00f4t !\n\nRooftop 58 - Nouvelle adresse exclusive\nRue de l'\u00c9v\u00eaque 1, Bruxelles, Belgique","performers":"Rooftop58","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/685481183938270\/","e