Boterstraat","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Korte Boterstraat, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"After travelling the world and the sevens seas, Famous Drag singer \u00ab LaDiva Live \u00bb settles down right in the centre of Brussels by opening a new venue called \u00ab Potiche \u00ab with Lara Fullcamp queen of burlesque.\nYou can expect Cabaret every Friday and Saturday with drag shows and live performances from 8 pm.\nKaraoke and after work parties every Thursdays from 7 pm\nTea dance with special guests and themes every Sunday from 5:30 pm.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_name":"Petite rue au Beurre","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Petite rue au Beurre, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_name":"Petite rue au Beurre","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Petite rue au Beurre, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_name":"Petite rue au Beurre","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Petite rue au Beurre, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"LaDiva Live, notre chanteuse Drag s\u2019installe \u00e0 Bruxelles apr\u00e8s avoir voyag\u00e9 autour du globe . \nAvec Lara Fullcamp, l\u2019extravagante queen burlesque, elle vous invite chez \u00ab Potiche \u00ab au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles et \u00e0 2 pas de la Grand place.\nAu programme: shows drag, burlesque et performances live tous les vendredis et samedis.\nKaraoke et after works les jeudis \u00e0 partir de 18h\nTea dances les Dimanches \u00e0 partir de 17h30 avec diff\u00e9rentes themes et artiste invit\u00e9s.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_name":"Petite rue au Beurre","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Petite rue au Beurre, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_name":"Korte Boterstraat","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Korte Boterstraat, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"LaDiva Live, onze dragzangeres, vestigt zich in Brussel na een reis rond de wereld. Samen met Lara Fullcamp, de extravagante burlesque queen, nodigt ze je uit bij \"Potiche\", in het hart van Brussel en op 2 st