tes guid\u00e9es d\u2019int\u00e9rieurs"],"sp":["Visitas guiadas en espacios interiores"],"nl":["Interieur rondleidingen"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"\u00c9loge de la Folie - Erasme et les ma\u00eetres anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/09\/eloge-de-la-folie-fr-28","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013266"},"pt":{"name":"\u00c9loge de la Folie - Erasme et les ma\u00eetres anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/09\/eloge-de-la-folie-fr-28","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013266"},"en":{"name":"\u00c9loge de la Folie - Erasme et les ma\u00eetres anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/09\/eloge-de-la-folie-fr-28","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013266"},"it":{"name":"\u00c9loge de la Folie - Erasme et les ma\u00eetres anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/09\/eloge-de-la-folie-fr-28","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013266"},"cn":{"name":"\u00c9loge de la Folie - Erasme et les ma\u00eetres anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/09\/eloge-de-la-folie-fr-28","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013266"},"fr":{"name":"\u00c9loge de la Folie - Erasme et les ma\u00eetres anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\u00c9loge de la Folie au c\u0153ur des collections Old Masters et au fil des textes d\u2019Erasme. \n\nGrand voyageur, Erasme est le premier penseur \u00e0 se d\u00e9finir comme Europ\u00e9en. \u00c0 l'aff\u00fbt de tous les savoirs, passionn\u00e9 d'imprimerie, il pr\u00f4ne l'acc\u00e8s de tous \u00e0 la culture et \u00e0 la connaissance.  \n\nUn duo de guides-conteurs proposent de lire, d\u00e9clamer et commenter les textes de ce r\u00e9formateur audacieux, \u00e9pris de tol\u00e9rance et de dialogue, tout en \u00e9tablissant des liens avec Hieronymus Bosch, le Ma\u00eetre de Fl\u00e9malle, Jacques Jordaens et autres Peter Paul Rubens...  \n\nUne fa\u00e7on originale de d\u00e9couvrir les collections mais aussi toute la modernit\u00e9 et l\u2019actualit\u00e9 br\u00fblante de cet ouvrage r\u00e9volutionnaire publi\u00e9 en 1509 ! \n\n\"Je disais donc que la Fortune aime les insens\u00e9s, les gens hardis et\u202ft\u00e9m\u00e9raires, ceux qui disent comme C\u00e9sar en passant le Rubicon :\u202fLe\u202fsort en est jet\u00e9. La sagesse rend les hommes timides. Aussi voit-on ordinairement tous ces sages sans cesse aux prises avec la pauvret\u00e9, la faim et la douleur, vivre obscurs, m\u00e9pris\u00e9s et d\u00e9test\u00e9s de tout le monde. Les fous au contraire, nagent dans l\u2019opulence, gouvernent les empires, en un mot, ils jouissent du sort le plus heureux et le plus florissant.\" ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/09\/eloge-de-la-folie-fr-28","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013266"},"sp":{"name":"\u00c9loge de la Folie - Erasme et les ma\u00eetres anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/09\/eloge-de-la-folie-fr-28","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013266"},"nl":{"name":"\u00c9loge de la Folie - Erasme et les ma\u00eetres anciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/09\/eloge-de-la-folie-fr-28","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013266"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium assemble 