aleries d'art"],"sp":["Dise\u00f1o","Galer\u00edas de arte"],"nl":["Design","Galeries"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"EXHIBITION \uff5c H\u00e9ritage(s) by Cl\u00e9ment Petibon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006493"},"pt":{"name":"EXHIBITION \uff5c H\u00e9ritage(s) by Cl\u00e9ment Petibon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006493"},"en":{"name":"H\u00e9ritage(s) by Cl\u00e9ment Petibon","shortdescr":"French ceramist Cl\u00e9ment Petibon grew up on the banks of the Loire, a closeness to nature that has left a lasting imprint on his imagination.","longdescr":"Fascinated by the effect of time on human lives and the evocative power of landscapes, he directs his research towards process art. Each stage of creation becomes essential to bring out ideas and discoveries. His artistic approach is one of exploration, where the material itself guides the process.\n\nHer series entitled H\u00e9ritage(s) questions Man's relationship with his environment through a cycle of construction - destruction - creation. Inspired by the domestic object as archetypal container, this series draws on collective memory nourished by centuries of stories and practices.\n\nCl\u00e9ment Petibon works with mixed clay, colored stoneware and porcelain, assembled using singular techniques. Using a blowtorch, he modifies the surface of the materials, revealing geological strata and offering an aesthetic marked by erosion. The material, sometimes altered to the point where voids appear, leaves room for the eye and reinterprets the function of the objects. \n\nHis sculptural creations evoke archaeological fragments and ancient frescoes, like witnesses to a past that helps us better understand our present identity.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006493"},"it":{"name":"EXHIBITION \uff5c H\u00e9ritage(s) by Cl\u00e9ment Petibon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006493"},"cn":{"name":"EXHIBITION \uff5c H\u00e9ritage(s) by Cl\u00e9ment Petibon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006493"},"fr":{"name":"H\u00e9ritage(s) de Cl\u00e9ment Petibon","shortdescr":"C\u00e9ramiste fran\u00e7ais, Cl\u00e9ment Petibon a grandi au bord de la Loire, une proximit\u00e9 avec la nature qui a marqu\u00e9 durablement son imaginaire.","longdescr":"Fascin\u00e9 par l\u2019effet du temps sur les vies humaines et la puissance \u00e9vocatrice des paysages, il oriente ses recherches vers l\u2019art processuel. Chaque \u00e9tape de cr\u00e9ation devient alors essentielle pour faire \u00e9merger id\u00e9es et d\u00e9couvertes. Sa d\u00e9marche artistique est celle d\u2019un cheminement d\u2019exploration, o\u00f9 la mati\u00e8re elle-m\u00eame guide le processus.\n\nSa s\u00e9rie intitul\u00e9e H\u00e9ritage(s) interroge la relation de l\u2019Homme \u00e0 son environnement \u00e0 travers un cycle de construction - destruction - cr\u00e9ation. Cette s\u00e9rie, inspir\u00e9e par l\u2019objet domestique comme arch\u00e9type du contenant, puise dans la m\u00e9moire collective nourrie de si\u00e8cles de r\u00e9cits et de pratiques.\n\nUtilisant des terres m\u00eal\u00e9es, Cl\u00e9ment Petibon travaille des gr\u00e8s et porcelaines color\u00e9s, assembl\u00e9s suivant des techniques singuli\u00e8res. Par l\u2019action du chalumeau, il modifie la surface des mat\u00e9riaux, r\u00e9v\u00e9lant des strates g\u00e9ologiques et offrant une esth\u00e9tique marqu\u00e9e par l\u2019\u00e9rosion. La mati\u00e8re, parfois alt\u00e9r\u00e9e jusqu\u2019\u00e0 l\u2019apparition de vides, laisse place au regard et r\u00e9interpr\u00e8te la fonction des objets. \n\nSes cr\u00e9ations, qui rel\u00e8vent de la sculpture, \u00e9voquent des fragments arch\u00e9ologiques et des fresques anciennes, comme autant de t\u00e9moins d\u2019un pass\u00e9 permettant de mieux comprendre notre identit\u00e9 actuelle.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006493"},"sp":{"name":"EXHIBITION \uff5c H\u00e9ritage(s) by Cl\u00e9ment Petibon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006493"},"nl":{"name":"H\u00e9ritage(s) van Cl\u00e9ment Petibon","shortdescr":"De Franse keramist Cl\u00e9ment Petibon groeide op aan de oevers van de Loire, een nauwe band met de natuur die een blijvende indruk op zijn verbeelding heeft achtergelaten.","longdescr":"Gefascineerd door het effect van tijd op mensenlevens en de suggestieve kracht van landschappen, richt hij zijn onderzoek op proceskunst. Elke fase van de creatie wordt essentieel om idee\u00ebn en ontdekkingen naar boven te halen. Zijn artistieke benadering is er een van verkenning, waarbij het materiaal zelf het proces stuurt.\n\nHaar serie getiteld H\u00e9ritage(s) bevraagt de relatie tussen de mens en zijn omgeving door middel van een cyclus van constructie - vernietiging - creatie. Ge\u00efnspireerd door het huiselijke object als archetypische container, put de serie uit het collectieve geheugen gevoed door eeuwen van verhalen en gebruiken.\n\nCl\u00e9ment Petibon werkt met gemengde klei, gekleurd steengoed en porselein, die hij met unieke technieken samenvoegt. Met behulp van een brander wijzigt hij het oppervlak van de materialen, waardoor geologische lagen zichtbaar worden en een esthetiek ontstaat die wordt gekenmerkt door erosie. Het materiaal, soms bewerkt tot er leegtes ontstaan, laat ruimte voor het oog en herinterpreteert de functie van de objecten. \n\nZijn sculpturale creaties doen denken aan archeologische fragmenten en oude fresco's, als getuigen van een verleden dat ons helpt beter te begrijpen wie we vandaag de dag zijn.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com\/pages\/expositions","email":"info@ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":"+32 470 41 57 56","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006493"}},"place":{"id":50001409,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Ma. Art Space","address_street_name":"Rue de la Victoire","address_street_number":"102","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ma-artspace.com","website":"https:\/\/ma-artspace.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 41 57 56","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Ru